exports[`loose-sublist-sample.md format 1`] = `
====================================options=====================================
parsers: ["markdown", "mdx"]
                                                      printWidth: 80 (default) |
=====================================input======================================
# Recording

1. Go to **File / Settings**
2. In the **Audio** tab and configure devices as follows

   - **Desktop Audio**: Disabled
   - **Mic/Auxilary Audio**: ADAT

   ![OBS](a.png)

3. In the **Output** tab

   <img src="a.png" alt="x" width="45%">

4. Open **Edit**

   - **Mic/Aux**: Tick track 1 only
   - **Mic/Aux 2**: Tick track 2 only

   ![OBS](b.png)

5. Done

=====================================output=====================================
# Recording

1. Go to **File / Settings**
2. In the **Audio** tab and configure devices as follows

   - **Desktop Audio**: Disabled
   - **Mic/Auxilary Audio**: ADAT

   ![OBS](a.png)

3. In the **Output** tab

   <img src="a.png" alt="x" width="45%">

4. Open **Edit**

   - **Mic/Aux**: Tick track 1 only
   - **Mic/Aux 2**: Tick track 2 only

   ![OBS](b.png)

5. Done

================================================================================
`;
